NOTE ON DATA

This license covers the SOURCE CODE in this repository only. It does NOT cover
the benchmark data under public_data/, which is redistributed under the
licenses of its original authors:

  - public_data/biolarkgsc/  CC BY 4.0
  - public_data/csc/         MIT (RAG-HPO, Posey Lab, Baylor College of Medicine)
  - public_data/raredis/     CC BY 4.0, (c) 2024 Isabel Segura-Bedmar

Our MIMIC-derived annotation files contain no clinical note text. Access to the
underlying MIMIC-III and MIMIC-IV notes requires PhysioNet credentialing under
their Data Use Agreement.

See public_data/README.md for full provenance and CITATIONS.md for attribution.
